<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.25;color:#0a0a0a;">
  Reset your password
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5ba60b;">
  Secure your account
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  We received a request to reset the password for the Dukka account associated with <strong>{{email}}</strong>. Use the verification code below to continue.
</p>

{{> code-box label="Your reset code" value=token}}

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  This code expires in <strong>{{expiresInSeconds}} seconds</strong>. Enter it promptly to choose a new password.
</p>

{{#> tip title="Didn't request this?"}}
  If you did not ask to reset your password, you can safely ignore this email. Your current password will remain unchanged. For extra peace of mind, review recent account activity or contact support.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  Protecting your account is our priority — thank you for staying vigilant.
</p>
